{"name":"Theymarsh","status":"ok","title":"Theymarsh","pageId":143892,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Theymarsh</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Border_Kingdoms\" title=\"Border Kingdoms\">Border Kingdoms</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ale\" title=\"Ale\">Ale</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-TBB-p_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBB-p-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>, glass<sup id=\"cite_ref-SF_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SF-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Between 1,000 and 2,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p152_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p152-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Theymarsh\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Theymarsh\">Inhabitants of  Theymarsh</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Theymarsh (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9UaGV5bWFyc2g/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Organizations in  Theymarsh</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Theymarsh&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Theymarsh</a></span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Theymarsh</b> was a port town on the <a href=\"/wiki/Lake_of_Steam\" title=\"Lake of Steam\">Lake of Steam</a>, part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Border_Kingdoms\" title=\"Border Kingdoms\">Border Kingdoms</a> region of <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p175_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p175-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_Organizations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Organizations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notable_Individuals\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Individuals</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p> Theymarsh stood on the <a href=\"/wiki/Strait_of_Storms\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strait of Storms\">Strait of Storms</a>, with the town of <a href=\"/wiki/Suldolphor\" title=\"Suldolphor\">Suldolphor</a> across from it. The Strait of Storms connected the Lake of Steam to the north with the <a href=\"/wiki/Shining_Sea\" title=\"Shining Sea\">Shining Sea</a> to the south.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p175_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p175-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Theymarsh's closest neighbor to the south was the town of <a href=\"/wiki/Yallasch\" title=\"Yallasch\">Yallasch</a>, connected to Theymarsh by a minor road. The <a href=\"/wiki/Neth_Stand\" title=\"Neth Stand\">Neth Stand</a> forest was immediately to the southeast from Theymarsh.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-map_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-map-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Theymarsh was known in the north for its delicate blown and worked glass – notably bird figurines.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SF_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SF-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Another export of note was a quality <a href=\"/wiki/Ale\" title=\"Ale\">ale</a> – a fine dark <span class=\"new\" title=\"Lager (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFnZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">lager</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBB-p_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBB-p-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Other major industries in Theymarsh were logging, mining, and <a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">fishing</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p152_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p152-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of the <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">Year of the Tankard, 1370 DR</a>, a pirate vessel of the first mate <a href=\"/wiki/Kalil_yi_Tulmon\" title=\"Kalil yi Tulmon\">Kalil yi Tulmon</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rundeen\" title=\"Rundeen\">Rundeen</a> regularly attacked merchant ships departing ports of <a href=\"/wiki/Almraiven\" title=\"Almraiven\">Almraiven</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Suldophor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suldophor\">Suldophor</a>, and Theymarsh. The attacks were cruel and ruthless, leaving many sailors dismembered.<sup id=\"cite_ref-C&D_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-C&D-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Organizations\">Notable Organizations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Organizations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Organizations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fallen Few (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFsbGVuX0Zldz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Fallen Few</span>, an assassins' guild of the Border Kingdoms, thought destroyed in Theymarsh as of <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BW-ch1_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BW-ch1-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Individuals\">Notable Individuals</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Individuals\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Individuals\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ssilban\" title=\"Ssilban\">Ssilban</a>, an infamous <a href=\"/wiki/Thief\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thief\">thief</a> of Theymarsh and an enemy of <a href=\"/wiki/Baelam\" title=\"Baelam\">Baelam</a> \"The Bold\", active in the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Drag172_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Drag172-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Theymarsh?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\n<dd><b><small>Referenced only</small></b></dd>\n<dd><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/Spellfire_(novel)\" title=\"Spellfire (novel)\">Spellfire</a></i> • <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Black_Bouquet\" title=\"The Black Bouquet\">The Black Bouquet</a></i> • <i><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodwalk\" title=\"Bloodwalk\">Bloodwalk</a></i> • <i><a href=\"/wiki/Realms_of_the_Dragons/Penitential_Rites\" title=\"Realms of the Dragons/Penitential Rites\">Penitential Rites</a></i></small></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsect